{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261024/photo/bkn-20261024072030173-1024_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261024080828\"/><p>現場為定泰樓。（陳俊華攝）</p><p>今日(24日)凌晨4時39分，執法部門接報指屯門安定邨定泰樓一單位，一名9歲女童情緒激動，持刀揮舞，父親見狀立即搶刀，混亂中，女童被刀鎅傷，胸口受傷流血。救援人員接報到場，將清醒女童送往屯門醫院救治。警員經調查後，以涉嫌「傷人」罪拘捕父親。事件經過及原因，有待進一步調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T00:23:55.902993+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":158,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T23:20:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T00:18:20.769236+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T00:18:20.769236+00:00","content_hash":"37dcf609436652f904af40918ac80ee35bbb46cbc9f8a64757d88b3dd8acf110","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}